# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id

# First-run environment config: contains Supabase URL + publishable key and any
# Razorpay key id the app should use. DO NOT commit a real env.json to a public
# repository. Keep this pattern file so the app folder is complete and the build
# does not fail, but fill in real values on each device/build before running.
assets/env.json
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

